---
globs: ["app/**/*.{ts,tsx}", "components/**/*.{ts,tsx}", "lib/**/*.{ts,tsx}"]
---

- Use Next.js App Router best practices
- Prefer Server Components by default
- Keep `page.tsx` files thin
- Move business logic to `lib/` or dedicated components
- Use shadcn/ui components from `@/components/ui`
- Handle `params` and `searchParams` as Promises (Next.js 15+)